= Piłsudski criticises parliament

In this game Józef Piłsudski speaks publicly against the Sejm over [+ pl_crit_topic +]. The wording is a synthetic game event, not a historical quotation. PPS must answer this month; the answer is recorded in the journal of institutions and does not change our lasting line on Piłsudski or on the form of power.

- @support
- @defend
- @reform

@support
title: Support the criticism of parliamentarism
subtitle: The relation with Piłsudski improves (+4); Piłsudczycy dissent falls (−3) and Centre dissent rises (+5). The authority of the Sejm falls for twelve months (−2). [+ pl_crit_warning +]
on-arrival: {!
PolishPolitics.criticismChoose(Q, 'support');
!}
go-to: result

@defend
title: Defend parliament and the lawful change of governments
subtitle: The relation with Piłsudski worsens (−4); Piłsudczycy dissent rises (+5) and Centre dissent falls (−3). The authority of the Sejm grows for twelve months (+1).
on-arrival: {!
PolishPolitics.criticismChoose(Q, 'defend');
!}
go-to: result

@reform
title: Parliament should be reformed to work better
subtitle: No change of relation; Centre dissent falls (−2). It supports the line of reform but creates no project, path or votes.
on-arrival: {!
PolishPolitics.criticismChoose(Q, 'reform');
!}
go-to: result

